{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926730/extras/03f99ff609e92176bd7688161d9f0104.avif?t=1760033382\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet <strong>Dorothy</strong>, the overly muscular maid of an evil mastermind, in a hilarious <strong>isometric twin-stick shooter</strong> where cleaning is just as deadly as combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, Dorothy must face a brand-new, randomly generated level overflowing with enemies and filth. Your goal: <strong>clean everything</strong>\u2014sweep away villains and mop up messes using an arsenal of outrageous cleaning tools turned into powerful weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with your trusty mop, unleash the destructive power of a vacuum cleaner, and discover other cleaning gadgets reimagined as instruments of mayhem.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to expect of Dorothy's Job?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Chaos</strong> \u2013 Each day brings new layouts, enemies, and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cleaning Tools of Destruction</strong> \u2013 Wield mops, vacuums, and more as deadly weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be a One Woman Army</strong>\u2013 Play as Dorothy, a maid who\u2019s as strong as she is unstoppable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action Meets Comedy</strong> \u2013 Over-the-top twin-stick action with a tongue-in-cheek sense of humor.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re scrubbing floors or blasting foes, <strong>Dorothy\u2019s Job</strong> proves that cleaning can be messy, chaotic, and ridiculously fun.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3926730?t=1760033382","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as